pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
elements:
  - elementId: header
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 66, 400, 28]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      fontFamily: LXGW Bright
      color: "$gray"
      letterSpacing: 4
      wrap: false
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 寻找异常值 · 02
  - elementId: header-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [80, 104, 56, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$red"}
  - elementId: sec-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [76, 160, 860, 90]
    content:
      fontSize: 54
      fontFamily: 阿里妈妈刀隶体
      color: "$ink"
      letterSpacing: 4
      wrap: false
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 信任始于一次「超纲」
  - elementId: body1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 290, 800, 200]
    content:
      fontSize: 25
      fontFamily: LXGW Bright
      color: "$body"
      lineHeight: 1.95
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>今年对接一个内部标签平台，产品团队想引入 AI 推荐能力，也希望数仓提供一些想法和产品使用反馈。</p>
        <p style="margin-top:18px">我根据自己的日常总结，当场列了 9 条建议：</p>
  - elementId: paper
    elementType: image
    bounds: [110, 470, 740, 430]
    src: media/torn_paper.png
    fit: {mode: fill}
    rotation: 1
  - elementId: paper-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [185, 530, 600, 320]
    rotation: 1
    content:
      fontSize: 24
      fontFamily: LXGW Bright
      color: "#4A4638"
      lineHeight: 2.0
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>· AI 推荐不干扰原有用户动线，</p>
        <p>　召回不足时再自动弹出</p>
        <p>· 标签描述支持富文本，突出重点</p>
        <p>· Hive 表名加超链接，</p>
        <p>　一键跳转到数据平台</p>
  - elementId: body2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 950, 800, 200]
    content:
      fontSize: 25
      fontFamily: LXGW Bright
      color: "$body"
      lineHeight: 1.95
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>这些都不属于数仓的范畴。但后续，产品经理多次主动来找我讨论方案细节。</p>
        <p style="margin-top:18px">只做<span style="color:$red">「回归值」</span>内的事——按时交付、不出错、不越界——短期看上去很安全，长期却会被困在越来越小的框架里。</p>
  - elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [760, 1190, 120, 28]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      fontFamily: LXGW Bright
      color: "$gray"
      wrap: false
      align: [right, middle]
      text: 04 / 06
